{"schemaVersion":1,"id":349,"sections":[{"id":"808001-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[20573],"start":0,"count":60},{"id":"808001-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[20574],"start":60,"count":8}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"808001-PROLOGUE:20573:1","scriptId":20573,"text":"随着旅行者的沉寂化，世界各地战车兽的行动也跟着缓和了下来。","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"808001-PROLOGUE:20573:2","scriptId":20573,"text":"然而这并不意味着事件的结束，很多不为人知的事情正在水面下涌动着。","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"808001-PROLOGUE:20573:3","scriptId":20573,"text":"特别是表面上已经没什么大动静的旅行者——","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"808001-PROLOGUE:20573:4","scriptId":20573,"text":"基地里两位旅行者正在讨论着什么。","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1110,"speaker":"菲","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"808001-PROLOGUE:20573:5","scriptId":20573,"text":"“这骸虫翼装感觉不错，兰布达还是一如既往的厉害。”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":1110,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"808001-PROLOGUE:20573:6","scriptId":20573,"text":"说话的人是旅行者菲，舒展了一下背后的“翅膀”，接受到命令的骸虫立刻“噗”得一声打开了折叠起来的翅膀。","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":1110,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"808001-PROLOGUE:20573:7","scriptId":20573,"text":"“注意飞行时的体力消耗问题，如果有什么不适可以马上告诉我。”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":1110,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"808001-PROLOGUE:20573:8","scriptId":20573,"text":"“恩，接下来我还要去柔那边看一下情况。”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":1110,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"808001-PROLOGUE:20573:9","scriptId":20573,"text":"兰布达开始使用自己的传送能力，身体周围开始冒出白色的光芒。","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":1110,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1110,"speaker":"菲","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"808001-PROLOGUE:20573:10","scriptId":20573,"text":"“诶，等等！”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":1110,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"808001-PROLOGUE:20573:11","scriptId":20573,"text":"菲叫住了兰布达。","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":1110,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"808001-PROLOGUE:20573:12","scriptId":20573,"text":"“什么事？翼装不适应吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":1110,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"808001-PROLOGUE:20573:13","scriptId":20573,"text":"兰布达眉头微微一皱，身上的白光开始渐渐消散。","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":1110,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1110,"speaker":"菲","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"808001-PROLOGUE:20573:14","scriptId":20573,"text":"“当然没有啦，翼装很完美，我就是对你和人类交流的事情很感兴趣，能不能给我讲讲啊？”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":1110,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"808001-PROLOGUE:20573:15","scriptId":20573,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":1110,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"808001-PROLOGUE:20573:16","scriptId":20573,"text":"“也不是不行，只是现在你还有测试要做，之后我有空的话——","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":1110,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1110,"speaker":"菲","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"808001-PROLOGUE:20573:17","scriptId":20573,"text":"“保持飞行状态是吧，我从刚才就一直在做啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":1110,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"808001-PROLOGUE:20573:18","scriptId":20573,"text":"菲指了指自己的脚——脚和地面有一点点的空隙，她现在一直处于浮空状态。","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":1110,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"808001-PROLOGUE:20573:19","scriptId":20573,"text":"“……哦，很好，你比埃普西隆灵巧多了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":1110,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1110,"speaker":"菲","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"808001-PROLOGUE:20573:20","scriptId":20573,"text":"“所以你才没给那个讨厌鬼做翼装吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":1110,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"808001-PROLOGUE:20573:21","scriptId":20573,"text":"“虽然她确实挺傻的，但是我也不希望她摔成肉酱。”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":1110,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1110,"speaker":"菲","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"808001-PROLOGUE:20573:22","scriptId":20573,"text":"“这倒也是，我先看看飞行状态能持续多久吧，就我目前的感觉，持续个一两天应该没问题。”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":1110,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"808001-PROLOGUE:20573:23","scriptId":20573,"text":"“因为我们现在是在地球的空气环境下，还是有不少未知情况的，谨慎行事。”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":1110,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1110,"speaker":"菲","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"808001-PROLOGUE:20573:24","scriptId":20573,"text":"“恩，上位大人们给我们的任务肯定要严格执行啦。”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":1110,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"808001-PROLOGUE:20573:25","scriptId":20573,"text":"“我想你也从其他人那里知道了吧，泰莱塔大人和阿尔库涅大人之间的矛盾。”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":1110,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1110,"speaker":"菲","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"808001-PROLOGUE:20573:26","scriptId":20573,"text":"“那么大的事情当然知道啦，听其他人说是同时收到了进攻和撤退的双重命令，因为举棋不定结果撤退的是大多数。”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":1110,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1110,"speaker":"菲","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"808001-PROLOGUE:20573:27","scriptId":20573,"text":"“如果那场死水大战我也在场就好了～”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":1110,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"808001-PROLOGUE:20573:28","scriptId":20573,"text":"“难道你也是个不要命的家伙？”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":1110,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1110,"speaker":"菲","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"808001-PROLOGUE:20573:29","scriptId":20573,"text":"“毕竟我有点好奇啦。”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":1110,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"808001-PROLOGUE:20573:30","scriptId":20573,"text":"“按人类的话来说，好奇心害死猫。”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":1110,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1110,"speaker":"菲","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"808001-PROLOGUE:20573:31","scriptId":20573,"text":"“虽然不知道你这句话的意思，但好像是对我的警告吧？”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":1110,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"808001-PROLOGUE:20573:32","scriptId":20573,"text":"“反正关于那两位大人的事情你别问东问西就对了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":1110,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1110,"speaker":"菲","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"808001-PROLOGUE:20573:33","scriptId":20573,"text":"“好吧好吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":1110,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"808001-PROLOGUE:20573:34","scriptId":20573,"text":"对菲那漫不经心的态度，兰布达叹了口气，接着说道。","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":1110,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"808001-PROLOGUE:20573:35","scriptId":20573,"text":"“既然你那么有闲心，那就安排你点事情做做吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":1110,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"808001-PROLOGUE:20573:36","scriptId":20573,"text":"接着兰布达开始对菲布置一系列的测试任务。","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":1110,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1110,"speaker":"菲","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"808001-PROLOGUE:20573:37","scriptId":20573,"text":"“啊哈～这些任务好像很有意思，总算不无聊了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":1110,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"808001-PROLOGUE:20573:39","scriptId":20573,"text":"几天后——","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":1110,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"808001-PROLOGUE:20573:40","scriptId":20573,"text":"一道光划破天际，速度之快让人难以捕捉，紧接着那道光急停化为一个光点，开始缓缓下落。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":1110,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"808001-PROLOGUE:20573:41","scriptId":20573,"text":"一位旅行者从空中降落到了一个荒废小镇上。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":1110,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"808001-PROLOGUE:20573:42","scriptId":20573,"text":"这片废墟曾是人类的居所，不过现在已经人去楼空，到处都是残破的瓦砾。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":1110,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1110,"speaker":"菲","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"808001-PROLOGUE:20573:43","scriptId":20573,"text":"“这里也没有吗……？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":1110,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"808001-PROLOGUE:20573:44","scriptId":20573,"text":"菲从兰布达那里收到的指令是调查不受旅行者控制的战车兽。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":1110,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"808001-PROLOGUE:20573:45","scriptId":20573,"text":"飞行战车兽的改造计划原本是泰莱塔的意思，她想通过空中力量对人类进行制裁。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":1110,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"808001-PROLOGUE:20573:46","scriptId":20573,"text":"不过事情并不是那么顺利，战车兽的思维进化速度远比旅行者想象中的要快。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":1110,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"808001-PROLOGUE:20573:47","scriptId":20573,"text":"有些战车兽开始试图逃跑，并且在最终测试阶段有好几头战车兽逃跑成功。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":1110,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"808001-PROLOGUE:20573:48","scriptId":20573,"text":"不过这一切问题的根源在于泰莱塔急于求成，强行把人类的线粒体植入战车兽所致。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":1110,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1110,"speaker":"菲","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"808001-PROLOGUE:20573:49","scriptId":20573,"text":"“仅仅有了思维能力就胆敢反抗高贵的意志，这些忘恩负义的家伙必须全部消灭。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":1110,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"808001-PROLOGUE:20573:50","scriptId":20573,"text":"菲一边检视着巢穴内的情况一边自言自语着。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":1110,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"808001-PROLOGUE:20573:51","scriptId":20573,"text":"战车兽这一反叛的行为自然是让泰莱塔怒不可歇，于是旅行者不得不开始处理她们自己造成的麻烦。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":1110,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1110,"speaker":"菲","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"808001-PROLOGUE:20573:52","scriptId":20573,"text":"“啊呀，这好像是战车兽的茧？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":1110,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"808001-PROLOGUE:20573:53","scriptId":20573,"text":"菲踢开一块巨大的碎石之后，发现了一间暗门，打开以后看到内部有不少茧状物。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":1110,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1110,"speaker":"菲","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"808001-PROLOGUE:20573:54","scriptId":20573,"text":"“随便带一个回去吧，不知道谁是幸运儿呢～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":1110,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"808001-PROLOGUE:20573:55","scriptId":20573,"text":"菲随手抱起一个茧，接着她把整个巢穴中的茧全部摧毁了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":1110,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"808001-PROLOGUE:20573:56","scriptId":20573,"text":"大量的液体从茧中渗漏出来，味道有些难闻，于是菲从房间里退了出来。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":1110,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1110,"speaker":"菲","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"808001-PROLOGUE:20573:57","scriptId":20573,"text":"“接下来去哪儿呢？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":1110,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"808001-PROLOGUE:20573:58","scriptId":20573,"text":"菲打开兰布达给她的地图，仔细端详了一番。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":1110,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"808001-PROLOGUE:20573:59","scriptId":20573,"text":"就在她看地图的瞬间——","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":1110,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"808001-PROLOGUE:20573:62","scriptId":20573,"text":"几枚炮弹在菲的身边炸裂，把整个巢穴变成了一片火海。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":1110,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":true},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1110,"speaker":"菲","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"808001-PROLOGUE:20573:63","scriptId":20573,"text":"“很好，省得我去找了，你们这些臭虫子。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":1110,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1110,"speaker":"菲","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"808001-EPILOGUE:20574:1","scriptId":20574,"text":"“不过就是一些有了脑子的臭虫子，蹬鼻子上脸可不行啊～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":1110,"right":56,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1112,"speaker":"装甲锹形虫","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"808001-EPILOGUE:20574:2","scriptId":20574,"text":"“夺还…失败……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":1110,"right":1112,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"808001-EPILOGUE:20574:3","scriptId":20574,"text":"菲把手中的骸虫弩弓用力一插，弓弩前端凸出的部分一下子就没入了装甲锹形虫的脑壳。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":1110,"right":1112,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"808001-EPILOGUE:20574:4","scriptId":20574,"text":"几下抽搐过后，被菲踩在脚下的生物便再也不动弹了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":1110,"right":1112,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1110,"speaker":"菲","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"808001-EPILOGUE:20574:5","scriptId":20574,"text":"“啊呀，不好，应该放跑一两只的……这样可以顺着逃跑路线一路追到它们的老巢。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":1110,"right":1112,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"808001-EPILOGUE:20574:6","scriptId":20574,"text":"虽然菲口中的话是这么说，但她一点都不懊恼的样子。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":1110,"right":1112,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"808001-EPILOGUE:20574:7","scriptId":20574,"text":"接着菲双脚一蹬高高跃起，在空中展开骸虫翼装，一对异样的翅膀显露了出来。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":1110,"right":1112,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1110,"speaker":"菲","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"808001-EPILOGUE:20574:8","scriptId":20574,"text":"“不过也算有点成果，就把这反抗者的茧带回去让她们研究下吧～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":1110,"right":1112,"section":1,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
